<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 14.529 million bushels of wheat, 55.791 million of corn and 38,000 bushels of barley inspected for export in the week ended Nov 14 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes     1,653    3,547	  NIL</p>
<p> Atlantic     27	 95	  NIL</p>
<p> Gulf	5,085   34,493	  NIL</p>
<p> Pacific   7,598   16,430	  NIL</p>
<p> Interior    166    1,226	  38</p>
